Complete a sustained mining and processing programme with derivations and applied work (@mine-course: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mining-and-mineral-engineering, #source "../sources/Penn-State-Introduction-to-Mining.lingua#r_5NAY6K47Y4Y61V4JF74JJNV4Q2", #source "../sources/Hard-Rock-Miners-Handbook.lingua#r_18YBY5XX4TFS7ZQSKTQMW34EFA", #source "../sources/Surface-Mining-Technology-NPTEL.lingua#r_5J36XSV6KZRNWX3J51Q4TRV7KG", #source "../sources/Underground-Metalliferous-Mining-NPTEL.lingua#r_5RZCS0BHH0FH6QKFB1V86NXRFJ", #source "../sources/Introduction-to-Mineral-Processing-NPTEL.lingua#r_5VQ67PA1160RQ1EWN17211XBWD", #source "../sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA", #source "../sources/CETEM-Praticas-Laboratoriais.lingua#r_44AAWXB1D7MBR9B0V3TYB8GF9B", #source "../sources/CETEM-Usinas-de-Beneficiamento.lingua#r_62ZD994C9YYXB1YDVFQST5B27J", #source "../sources/Practical-Rock-Engineering-Hoek.lingua#r_5VDNJTZ30N76R8Y5DP3T212SGP", #source "../sources/McPherson-Subsurface-Ventilation.lingua#r_3KH110VQV6VEA56FVWV8D7W6AY", #mining-and-mineral-engineering "Sustained-material-characterization-and-processing-laboratory.lingua#r_1NH1Y0TDS8D47PPDEQFYYC1P6Z") { r_1XQHJ15KB0BTJ9Z0GBXT5F2W6P
**Read:** [Introduction to Mining Engineering — Penn State MNG 230](../sources/Penn-State-Introduction-to-Mining.lingua#r_5NAY6K47Y4Y61V4JF74JJNV4Q2), the complete course; [Hard Rock Miner’s Handbook — Jack de la Vergne, fifth edition](../sources/Hard-Rock-Miners-Handbook.lingua#r_18YBY5XX4TFS7ZQSKTQMW34EFA), the whole handbook; [Surface Mining Technology — Kaushik Dey, NPTEL](../sources/Surface-Mining-Technology-NPTEL.lingua#r_5J36XSV6KZRNWX3J51Q4TRV7KG), the complete public course; [Underground Mining of Metalliferous Deposits — Mandal and Dey, NPTEL](../sources/Underground-Metalliferous-Mining-NPTEL.lingua#r_5RZCS0BHH0FH6QKFB1V86NXRFJ), the complete public course; [Introduction to Mineral Processing — Arun Kumar Majumder, NPTEL](../sources/Introduction-to-Mineral-Processing-NPTEL.lingua#r_5VQ67PA1160RQ1EWN17211XBWD), the complete public course; [Tratamento de Minérios — CETEM, sixth edition](../sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA), the whole sixth edition; [Tratamento de Minérios: Práticas Laboratoriais — Sampaio, França, and Braga](../sources/CETEM-Praticas-Laboratoriais.lingua#r_44AAWXB1D7MBR9B0V3TYB8GF9B), the whole manual; [Usinas de Beneficiamento de Minérios do Brasil — CETEM](../sources/CETEM-Usinas-de-Beneficiamento.lingua#r_62ZD994C9YYXB1YDVFQST5B27J), the whole casebook; [Practical Rock Engineering — Evert Hoek](../sources/Practical-Rock-Engineering-Hoek.lingua#r_5VDNJTZ30N76R8Y5DP3T212SGP), the whole book; [Subsurface Ventilation Engineering — Malcolm J. McPherson](../sources/McPherson-Subsurface-Ventilation.lingua#r_3KH110VQV6VEA56FVWV8D7W6AY), the whole authorized English book.

Complete the entire MNG 230 reading sequence and Hard Rock Miner's Handbook with a calculation notebook and an account of where each estimate applies. Complete the public surface-mining and underground-metalliferous NPTEL sequences; for each, work through the stated theory, examples, reading, and an independently constructed design comparison. A public lecture collection is not assumed to include every campus assessment.

Read all twenty chapters of Tratamento de Minérios and complete the mineral-processing lecture sequence. Work through the full Práticas Laboratoriais manual, distinguishing methods performed in a suitable laboratory from studies of supplied observations. Read Usinas de Beneficiamento de Minérios do Brasil in full and reconstruct two substantially different integrated plant cases. Do not infer current operating conditions from those historical descriptions.

For advanced ground and environmental systems, read the complete Hoek and McPherson books and the water, acid/metalliferous drainage, tailings, closure, and rehabilitation handbooks. Read the full research/reporting/standard works assigned in the later studies. Use the named source editions and complete relevant government technical manuals. Wills, Principles of Mineral Processing, and the SME Mining Engineering Handbook offer additional sustained professional reading through authorized access.

**Work:** derive representative governing relations in ground behavior, transport/cycles, ventilation, water, and mineral separation; reproduce and independently check substantial examples across those families. Compare assumptions with measured or published observations and preserve failed predictions. Connect each calculation to the next operation and its material/utility/work account. The following studies deepen selected problems beyond survey-course coverage; whole-book reading supports them rather than replacing investigation with a reading count.

**Continue:** [Build and defend a connected material-characterization and processing investigation](Sustained-material-characterization-and-processing-laboratory.lingua#r_1NH1Y0TDS8D47PPDEQFYYC1P6Z).

**Return:** [Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work](../Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA).
